{"generated": "2026-11-12 02:42", "brief": "<b>1. 앤트로픽 역대 최대 규모 IPO 추진 및 글로벌 AI 기업 동향</b>\nAI 스타트업 앤트로픽이 기업가치 최대 1.4조~1.894조 달러를 목표로 19일 유력 상장을 추진 중이며, 기관 및 개인 투자자의 수요 폭주로 공모가 인상 가능성이 제기되고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTE41VVZ6d1k3NkEwblJVWjNJRFVKOFZ3ZmJhU0xoQnlBbzFZTkEyb3BxdTRTSkZNbmZfX2NieDZub2RSTGJlcTRlQ1N3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9fUDVudDNnY0NacGpaS2dEOHJKd3lKZENWSXVqVDV6TmE5QmJVa3N4UXBVV2tHN0JBemNibUY5dzVtaFVXV0kxdkMxcFdMXzRSQkJyWVNETFE4Zw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#23</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFBiaU5RcTRyWnBYb3FLaXFsRDFMYlZDMUlnQkVPdUxjY3pnTWJDb3EzMnRXZ3pjbE1ONzNpTzJHMzM0R0prQnFsd1dSWGZNUF9X?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPSkc4cW15aGVaZG4tLTR1YVpRUWJzNXVtQ0RyR2d1bEFXTFFIU2xhWEduUmxTUFJWZEt0cVh3ZDNxNnRwV2k0WFlnMlNycWpycVVSNGl0Qy1NMlhvZVBUWVhVVGhISDZpcUxBdGVFQnRXRzhCTGZYZVEzUEh1MjlBOFZ6X2p3eG4tUlF3a3NNUXhzYzU5d0NmcVhqS1QzcG5DMUItVWlDdlJ3U1ZoU0tscy1xa3Fxbnh2dHhPYmpNQ1VZOUk0?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#36</a>]. 알파벳이 100억 달러 투자 조달에 참여하는 등 주목받는 가운데, 엔스케일의 뉴욕 상장 연기 검토 및 중국 YMTC의 내년 1분기 상장 추진 등 글로벌 AI·반도체 기업들의 셈법도 복잡해지고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNNXI0YjBJaUF4LTdSLVlMSXFkdG5GTDRMaFVDaElBUlhPcXNSRWotR1FLbTRSU3hKT3FYWXQyOFNSRmtva2lwRlo1WkIxZWdLUUhlT3hOYWdodk05d3prM0JGUXRGMWxkZ0NxR0N1VFJVaW8yZE1tWmt0cmpMUUdPRkdkUjhqQXd4?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#33</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOaDhxbUFQYl9aLWJtTFdOZGhVdy1aU1R1N2tsa0p5RDh6eE9rNnJGWWlPX3EwWEpVRUEtUUdTb21ULUJWcTFFMFIwMnpxbnItdUwtU18wWXJfMjV6bzRRaEJUbzBIdXZnZ1hEbTZsSjBpSm1LZWJXWmhnZXBJamZvWFpyaWxzdG5mcjVVbA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#39</a>].\n\n<b>2. 정책금융기관의 벤처·혁신성장 펀드